  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Nutrition Governance and Resilience</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to contribute to improved nutritional outcomes for children under five through stronger Government systems. 

The specific objectives of the project are to:

1)	Improve the multisectoral Food and Nutrition   coordination, governance, and financing. 
2)	Strengthen systems for quality service delivery of nutrition interventions, including emergency preparedness and response. 
3)	Strengthen social and behaviour change interventions to improve childcare and feeding practice.</narrative>
  </description>
